para.formula:
\[
deg(v) =
\begin{cases}
\vert\{e \in E : v \in e\}\vert & \text{if } H \text{ is undirected}
\\ deg_{in}(v) + deg_{out}(v) & \text{if } H \text{ is BF-directed}
\end{cases}
\]

